  design: no \`rounded*\` and no \`shadow*\` in the static state.

  Accessibility: phone and email are real anchors with descriptive text;
  social anchors carry \`aria-label\`, \`target="_blank"\` and
  \`rel="noopener noreferrer"\`; decorative icons are \`aria-hidden="true"\`.
